{"id":"n14358-1-7","stage":2,"title":"대충 · 大概","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14358-1-7-1","ko":"내가 무슨 말을 하는지 알겠어요?","zh":"你知道我在说什么吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말을","audio":"/audio/e897e0419e4ab64902fd.mp3"}},{"text":"하는지","meaning":"表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"하다：表示说这样那样的话。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는지","audio":"/audio/8c05a41a8e0242417da2.mp3"}},{"text":"알겠어요?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알겠어요","audio":"/audio/3af262f285badbf60003.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示说这样那样的话。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示说这样那样的话。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/660e95d12162a5978801.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14358-1-7-2","ko":"네, 대충 이해가 돼요.","zh":"嗯，大致能明白。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"대충","meaning":"大概，大致，大体","explanation":"대충：大概，大致，大体","readings":[{"term":"대충","audio":"/audio/dccccc5cc19b6b212129.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14358","senseId":"1","lemma":"대충","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대충","audio":"/audio/dccccc5cc19b6b212129.mp3"}},{"text":"이해가","meaning":"理解，领悟","explanation":"이해：理解，领悟；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"이해","audio":"/audio/da2995a8c183c1cabd41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69533","senseId":"1","lemma":"이해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이해가","audio":"/audio/9efaae2eeb1afe250240.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfac